▪️Part of US policy to encircle, contain, and topple Iran is dismantling this network directly or through proxies - especially via Israel but also through other regional proxies like ISIS/Al Qaeda, Saudi Arabia, Qatar, Turkey, etc.;

▪️The toppling of Syria in 2024 literally created air corridors the US used to begin striking Iran directly the same year;

